# AI skill packages (Claude/Cursor skill format). The directories are root-only:
# an unanchored *-skill/ also hides skills/<name>-skill/ in a skills repo.
*.skill
/*-skill/
/*-skill-unpacked/

# Repo preflight / context artifacts (repomix, aider map, llm prompts)
.repomix/
repomix-output.*
aider.repo-map.txt
llm-prompt.md

# kb work notes (the kb skill), local to this machine. Root-only: skills/kb/ in
# the kb repo is source, and apply.py leaves these out where kb/ is committed.
/kb/
/.kb/

# Timestamped pre-edit backups (incl. ai-gitignore skill's own .gitignore backups)
*._MOD_backup.*

